ement to the scene. Beyond the tree is a wooden privacy fence, blending seamlessly with the natural landscape. The blue sky overhead is clear and cloudless, contributing to the tranquil and inviting ambiance of the space. The balance of natural and architectural elements evokes a sense of refined calmness."], "The individual shown is wearing a formal navy suit jacket with black lapels paired with a crisp white dress shirt. Their hair appears thick, styled loosely, and has a slightly tousled texture. This gives off a polished yet relaxed aesthetic. The visible neck area suggests a fair complexion, and the clean dress conveys a sophisticated appearance fitting for formal occasions. Unfortunately, without additional unblurred facial details or context like identifying features, no specific characters or names can be confirmed."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 722, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 409, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "describe", "slot_index": 0, "links": [722], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING"}], "size": [276.9352864114262, 171.867250744609], "pos": [-4168, 2260], "widgets_values": ["Describe the facial features of the person in the picture. If any characters in the image are familiar to you, please directly use their names. The description should be as detailed as possible, but should not exceed 100 words."], "inputs": [{"name": "ref_image", "link": 723, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 408, "type": "RH_Captioner", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 14}], "extra": {"ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "groupNodes": {}, "ds": {"offset": {"0": 4104.3037109375, "1": -1601.6484375}, "scale": 1.0610764609500245}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 40, "title": "ACE_Plus FFT Workflow